# printers_sim.jgs -- jgraph.usb.printers and jgraph.usb.printraw on jgraph.internal.printsim's queues,
# and the shape of jgraph.usb.netadapter (device classes plan, stage D12, ADR 0196). JGraph-only: these
# are JGraph extensions with no MATLAB counterpart, so expected/printers_sim.txt is written from the
# rule. The cases are MATLAB code in helpers/printers_sim_case.m.

